[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4686254254","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120205#issuecomment-4686254254","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120205","id":4686254254,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABF1KQrg","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-12T00:26:45Z","updated_at":"2026-06-12T00:27:16Z","body":"The original reasoning for not adding draco has two parts: it wasn't part of the core gltf2 spec and I couldn't find a massive demand for it weighted to code added.\r\n\r\nHas any of those reasoning changed?\r\n\r\nAlso implementing meshopt compression in gltf is technically superior.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4686254254/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4686344002","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120205#issuecomment-4686344002","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120205","id":4686344002,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABF1PvQg","user":{"login":"vorvek","id":9655848,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTU4NDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9655848?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek","html_url":"https://github.com/vorvek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-12T00:47:21Z","updated_at":"2026-06-12T00:47:21Z","body":"I understand that meshopt is better in terms of decode speed and it covers animation data. But on file size for static meshes it generally doesn't beat Draco.\r\n\r\nI feel like the reason there's no demand for Draco at the moment is that it's not supported. The option is right there in Blender. Draco is the KHR-ratified extension (unlike meshopt, ironically). What happens at the moment is that someone exports a gltf in Blender, enables compression, and it doesn't work, so they export again without compression and that's that. Meshopt doesn't solve that, since it's not like it's competing when the asset uses either or neither.\r\n\r\nPlus, the core already supports KHR_texture_transform and KHR_node_visibility.\r\n\r\nI'd be happy to add EXT_meshopt_compression import as a follow-up. The codecs are already vendored in thirdparty/meshoptimizer for LOD, so it would add almost no new code. And if the concern is decoder weight in core builds, everything here is behind GLTF_HAS_DRACO, so an SCons flag to exclude it is a small change.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4686344002/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4686511767","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120205#issuecomment-4686511767","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120205","id":4686511767,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABF1Z-lw","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-12T01:26:40Z","updated_at":"2026-06-12T01:26:40Z","body":"I believe the metric to watch is the template builds, typically the editor builds have more leeway.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4686511767/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4686658954","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120205#issuecomment-4686658954","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120205","id":4686658954,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABF1i9ig","user":{"login":"vorvek","id":9655848,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTU4NDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9655848?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek","html_url":"https://github.com/vorvek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vorvek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-12T02:00:34Z","updated_at":"2026-06-12T02:00:34Z","body":"It's around 300 KB in my tests (adding meshopt too). I'm not sure if it can be made any smaller. We could possibly default it to off in the build templates, as its use would be limited to mods and such, right?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4686658954/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4697857218","html_url":"https://github.com/go